data a_provisional_verify_bound_is_a_bet_until_its_sample_is_recorded: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "a_provisional_verify_bound_is_a_bet_until_its_sample_is_recorded" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungUnread { cause: BlockerClassUnstated },

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a verification entry with no recorded compile sample (gunbc.live_deploy.belt_cadence verify_entry_compile_samples) runs under a bound borrowed from the slowest recorded sample (VerifyRunProvisional). The figure is a bet, not a measurement of that entry.",

    "HARM: a borrowed figure below the entry's real compile time lets the unit kill an honest verification at its outer limit, which is the failure the derived bound exists to prevent; a figure far above it widens the window in which a wedged run holds a compute seat. Today only the unit's outer limit is enforced, so the per-node bound is a receipt figure, not a limit.",

    "DISTINGUISHING FACT: the attempt receipt line begins ProvisionalUnsampled and names every unsampled entry and the sample it borrowed, so the population is countable per attempt. Samples recorded today: one (roadmap_belt_tick_cli, a local reading, not an srv1 unit reading).",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: mitigatable (DESIGN 4b): the bet is typed, visible and bounded by the entry ceiling, but nothing yet turns a bet into a measurement.",

    "CEILING: structurally guaranteed: no Accepted verify bound rests on an entry without a recorded sample, because the measured figure is a row the compile writes, not an authored constant.",

    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, A CAPABILITY: writing back the measured process_invocation_total of an unsampled entry's first run as that entry's EntryCompileSample, so the bet dissolves on first use. Not modeled: verify_entry_compile_samples is a hand-authored data row. A second capability, enforcing the per-node bound as the run's own limit rather than only the unit's outer limit, is gated on a per-run deadline in the compute work request.",
  ],

  evidence: [
    decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.live_deploy.belt_cadence", decl_name: "verify_run_bound_for"),
    decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.live_deploy.belt_cadence", decl_name: "verify_entry_compile_samples"),
  ],
}
